tarts a full peal runs for two hours\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The band works through a full peal without a break.\",\n      \"line\": 15,\n      \"span\": \"the band works through it without a break\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A full peal took two hours from the first stroke to the last.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"From the first stroke to the last a full peal took two hours\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Nobody left the ringing chamber during a full peal.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"nobody left the ringing chamber in between\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The bells are rung on the first Sunday of every month.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"The bells are rung on the first Sunday of every month\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The village has always kept the hour by the bells.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"the village has always kept the hour by them\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The narrator and the ringing band rang on the first Sunday of the month, every month.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"We rang on the first Sunday of the month, every month\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"People in the village knew the hour from the sound of the bells.\",\n      \"line\": 21,\n      \"span\": \"people in the village knew the hour from the sound\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":107047,"type":"result","duration_ms":113982,"uuid":"5e118428-1926-4b93-919b-d61a7913dd82","ttft_stream_ms":664,"time_to_request_ms":92,"first_content_frame_ms":664,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
